{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down endless hordes of enemies while crafting your most powerful build to survive until the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices\u2014what weapons you pick and how you play\u2014can completely change the outcome, making every run a new adventure you'll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the onslaught until time runs out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/game.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine each character's unique skills with a wide variety of weapons to create your ultimate build and crush the approaching enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock weapons and power-ups in the shop and upgrade your parameters to broaden your strategy options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up with Lucky Boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/LuckySlot.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies may drop Lucky Boxes. Open one to spin a slot and get a chance to power up your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger massive level-ups and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-slot machine support system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/minislot2.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the mini-slot at the bottom of the screen lands a match, items will appear on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you get\u2014and when\u2014depends entirely on how you fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumor has it that upgrading your &quot;Luck&quot; makes it easier to win big!?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3243710?t=1750300956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/d114965e8a944a63d44db80a624a16278937fadc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750300956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/75d96a549a7797b62d09120bae27631ce5eac69a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750300956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/75d96a549a7797b62d09120bae27631ce5eac69a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750300956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down endless hordes of enemies while crafting your most powerful build to survive until the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices\u2014what weapons you pick and how you play\u2014can completely change the outcome, making every run a new adventure you'll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the onslaught until time runs out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/game.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine each character's unique skills with a wide variety of weapons to create your ultimate build and crush the approaching enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock weapons and power-ups in the shop and upgrade your parameters to broaden your strategy options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up with Lucky Boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/LuckySlot.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies may drop Lucky Boxes. Open one to spin a slot and get a chance to power up your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger massive level-ups and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-slot machine support system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/minislot2.png?t=1750300956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the mini-slot at the bottom of the screen lands a match, items will appear on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you get\u2014and when\u2014depends entirely on how you fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumor has it that upgrading your &quot;Luck&quot; makes it easier to win big!?</p>","developers":["D.H Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/e2f8da66ec112760c4515c7b31adadbc152439be/header.jpg?t=1750300956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}